---
import Card from './ui/Card.astro';
import IconCircle from './ui/IconCircle.astro';
import BulletItem from './ui/BulletItem.astro';
import IndustryTag from './ui/IndustryTag.astro';
import Button from './ui/Button.astro';
---
<section class="py-24 bg-[#111111]">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#F0F0F0] mb-4">Who It's For</h2>
    <p class="text-[#9CA3AF] text-lg mb-14 max-w-2xl">
      We work with operations-heavy businesses where manual overhead is quietly eating margin.
    </p>

    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">

      <!-- Construction Companies -->
      <Card>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <IconCircle>
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#C9A84C]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 21h19.5m-18-18v18m10.5-18v18m6-13.5V21M6.75 6.75h.75m-.75 3h.75m-.75 3h.75m3-6h.75m-.75 3h.75m-.75 3h.75M6.75 21v-3.375c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h2.25c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125V21M3 3h12m-.75 4.5H21m-3.75 3.75h.008v.008h-.008v-.008zm0 3h.008v.008h-.008v-.008zm0 3h.008v.008h-.008v-.008z" />
            </svg>
          </IconCircle>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#F0F0F0]">Construction Companies</h3>
        </div>

        <p class="text-[#9CA3AF] mb-4 leading-relaxed">
          You've got crews on three job sites, a project manager drowning in RFIs, and a superintendent who's manually entering time logs into software that crashes on Tuesdays. Here's what's actually eating your margin:
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-6">
          <IndustryTag text="General Contractors" />
          <IndustryTag text="Subcontractors" />
        </div>

        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <BulletItem title="Scheduling gaps." description=" Crew shows up, materials aren't there. Or materials are there, crew isn't. Both cost money." />
          <BulletItem title="RFI delays." description=" A question sits in someone's inbox for four days. The job stops. The clock runs." />
          <BulletItem title="Safety documentation." description=" Everyone knows it has to be done. Nobody wants to do the paperwork. Agents handle the capture, filing, and reminders." />
          <BulletItem title="Cost overruns." description=" Usually traceable to something that wasn't tracked in real time. Agents track it in real time." />
        </ul>

        <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-[#C9A84C] border border-[#C9A84C]/20 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 bg-[#C9A84C]/5">
          If you're running $2M+ in annual revenue and your internal systems run on more than one software solution, this is for you.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-6">
          <Button variant="outline" href="/industries/construction" size="sm">
            Learn More About Construction Solutions
          </Button>
        </div>
      </Card>

      <!-- Rental Companies -->
      <Card>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <IconCircle>
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#C9A84C]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M20.25 7.5l-.625 10.632a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.247 2.118H6.622a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.247-2.118L3.75 7.5M10 11.25h4M3.375 7.5h17.25c.621 0 1.125-.504 1.125-1.125v-1.5c0-.621-.504-1.125-1.125-1.125H3.375c-.621 0-1.125.504-1.125 1.125v1.5c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125z" />
            </svg>
          </IconCircle>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#F0F0F0]">Rental Companies</h3>
        </div>

        <p class="text-[#9CA3AF] mb-4 leading-relaxed">
          Your whole business runs on knowing what's out, what's back, what's available, and getting quotes out before the customer calls someone else. The manual overhead adds up fast:
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-6">
          <IndustryTag text="Party Rental" />
          <IndustryTag text="Tool &amp; Equipment Rental" />
        </div>

        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <BulletItem title="Customer communication gaps." description=" Confirmation emails don't go out. Delivery windows don't get confirmed. Agents handle every touchpoint from booking to pickup." />
          <BulletItem title="Team communication breakdowns." description=" The upcoming order for tomorrow has a major change. The rental consultant takes it — but it never makes it back to the delivery crew, and the wrong order gets loaded." />
          <BulletItem title="Content stuck on someone's phone." description=" You have amazing pictures taken at job sites that were supposed to go on your website and social media to show your equipment in action. Instead they end up stuck in somebody's phone or hard drive and never make it out." />
        </ul>

        <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-[#C9A84C] border border-[#C9A84C]/20 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 bg-[#C9A84C]/5">
          If your business runs on bookings and logistics, there's a lot of room to cut manual work here.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-6">
          <Button variant="outline" href="/industries/rental" size="sm">
            Learn More About Rental Solutions
          </Button>
        </div>
      </Card>

      <!-- Event Companies -->
      <Card>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <IconCircle>
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#C9A84C]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6.75 3v2.25M17.25 3v2.25M3 18.75V7.5a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 7.5v11.25m-18 0A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 18.75m-18 0v-7.5A2.25 2.25 0 015.25 9h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 11.25v7.5m-9-6h.008v.008H12v-.008zM12 15h.008v.008H12V15zm0 2.25h.008v.008H12v-.008zM9.75 15h.008v.008H9.75V15zm0 2.25h.008v.008H9.75v-.008zM7.5 15h.008v.008H7.5V15zm0 2.25h.008v.008H7.5v-.008zm6.75-4.5h.008v.008h-.008v-.008zm0 2.25h.008v.008h-.008V15zm0 2.25h.008v.008h-.008v-.008zm2.25-4.5h.008v.008H16.5v-.008zm0 2.25h.008v.008H16.5V15z" />
            </svg>
          </IconCircle>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#F0F0F0]">Event Companies</h3>
        </div>

        <p class="text-[#9CA3AF] mb-4 leading-relaxed">
          The logistics are brutal and the margins are thin. Every event is a deadline you can't miss, and most of the coordination still happens over text threads and spreadsheets. Your specific headaches:
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-6">
          <IndustryTag text="Venues" />
          <IndustryTag text="Caterers" />
          <IndustryTag text="Event Planners" />
        </div>

        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <BulletItem title="Vendor coordination." description=" Chasing confirmations, keeping timelines updated, making sure every vendor has the right info. Agents handle the back-and-forth." />
          <BulletItem title="Client communication volume." description=" Every client wants updates. Agents send them automatically, so your team isn't repeating the same answers all day." />
          <BulletItem title="Booking and contract admin." description=" Intake forms, contracts, deposits, signed documents. Agents collect it all, file it, and flag anything missing before the event gets close." />
          <BulletItem title="Day-of logistics." description=" Staff assignments, run-of-show distribution, last-minute changes. The prep work that burns hours can run mostly on autopilot." />
        </ul>

        <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-[#C9A84C] border border-[#C9A84C]/20 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 bg-[#C9A84C]/5">
          If you're managing multiple events at once and the coordination overhead is killing your margins, this is for you.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-6">
          <Button variant="outline" href="/industries/events" size="sm">
            Learn More About Events Solutions
          </Button>
        </div>
      </Card>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
